Kadi4Mat (https://kadi.iam.kit.edu, https://gitlab.com/iam-cms/kadi)
Copyright 2020 Karlsruhe Institute of Technology
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  * src/kadi_lab_manager/extras.py is a derivative work: a standalone port of
    kadi/modules/records/extras.py (classes ExtraSchema, _ValidationSchema and
    the helper functions _validate_extra_value, filter_extras, remove_extra_values,
    extras_to_plain_json) from Kadi4Mat release 1.14.0. The validation rules and
    several server messages are reproduced so that the port behaves exactly like
    the server; Flask, SQLAlchemy and marshmallow dependencies were removed and
    time-zone handling was added. See the header of that file for the list of
    modifications.
  * tests/mock_kadi.py reproduces the behaviour of the Kadi4Mat HTTP API v1
    (status codes, response shapes, a few error messages) for offline testing. It
    was written after studying the Kadi4Mat source code.
  * docs/KADI4MAT-EXPORT-REFERENCE.md documents the export formats of Kadi4Mat
    based on its source code and public documentation.

