The structure of the metadata templates in model/ (nested blocks, controlled
option lists, units, required flags, composable sub-templates) was informed by the
publicly shared template library of the Karlsruhe Nano Micro Facility (KNMFi) at
KIT. No KNMFi template content is included in this repository.

